# Implementation Plan - True Real-Time Conversational VAD Voice Agent

Transform the Smart Learn Voice Agent from push-to-talk into a true real-time conversational agent powered by Web Audio Voice Activity Detection (VAD), automatic speech boundary detection (speech start & silence window detection), continuous segment recording, barge-in interruption, network `AbortController` cancellation, and zero manual clicks between turns.

## Proposed Architecture & State Machine

```
               ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
               │                      VOICE MODE ON                     │
               └───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘
                                           │
                                           ▼
┌─────────────────┐      Speech Start     ┌─────────────────┐
│    LISTENING    ├──────────────────────►│    HEARING      │
│ (VAD Monitoring)│                       │(Capturing Chunks)│
└────────▲────────┘                       └────────┬────────┘
         │                                         │ Silence Window (600-900ms)
         │                                         ▼
         │                                ┌─────────────────┐
         │                                │   FINALIZING    │
         │                                └────────┬────────┘
         │                                         │
         │                                         ▼
         │                                ┌─────────────────┐
         │                                │   TRANSCRIBING  │
         │                                │  (/api/ai/trans)│
         │                                └────────┬────────┘
         │                                         │ Valid Transcript
         │                                         ▼
         │                                ┌─────────────────┐
         │                                │    THINKING     │
         │                                │ (Smart AI Agent)│
         │                                └────────┬────────┘
         │                                         │
         │                                         ▼
         │       TTS Completed            ┌─────────────────┐
         └────────────────────────────────┤   SPEAKING_AI   │
             (Or Barge-In Interrupt)      │(TTS Assistant)  │
                                          └─────────────────┘
```

