## Proposed Changes

### 1. Web Audio VAD & Segment Recorder Engine

#### [MODIFY] [speech-recorder.ts](file:///d:/Institute/BCE/src/lib/ai/speech-recorder.ts)

- Add `WebAudioVAD` & `AudioEnergyAnalyzer`:
  - Create `AudioContext` and `AnalyserNode` connected to active `MediaStream`.
  - Calculate real-time RMS energy level of incoming audio frames.
  - Implement configurable thresholds:
    - `SPEECH_ENERGY_THRESHOLD = 0.018`
    - `SILENCE_WINDOW_MS = 750ms` (configurable 600-900ms range)
    - `MIN_SPEECH_DURATION_MS = 300ms`
- Enhance `AudioRecorder`:
  - Request constraints: `audio: { echoCancellation: true, noiseSuppression: true, autoGainControl: true }`.
  - Support segment-based recording: keep the underlying `MediaStream` active while creating fresh `MediaRecorder` segments per speech turn.
  - Support `AbortController` signal for STT network requests (`transcribeAudioFile(blob, mimeType, abortSignal)`).

